  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>20</mn><mn>40</mn></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2.50",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As,&nbsp;<math><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math>&nbsp; .... (i)<br /><br />Applying <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> property, we get,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>20</mn><mn>40</mn></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp; ... (ii)<br /><br />Adding (i) and (ii), we get,&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow></munderover><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2.5</mn></math></p>",
